p of the individual or  this worship of the collective but  hopefully be able to retain as much as  we can this notion of self denial of  self sacrifice which is bound in the  sacrifice of the god man  so I hope you enjoyed this video on this  interpretation of Avengers infinity 2  where I thought it would be an  interesting thing to do as we are you  know as we're on the verge of the next  movie coming out and I have a quite a  few things coming very soon in May I  will be in Seattle as some of you know I  really giving a conference there I will  put the link in the description I will  also be in Louisiana in May and be  giving some talks there as well so two  opportunities if you want to come out  and meet me I would love I love to meet  the people watch my videos this is very  anonymous online with all these avatars  and YouTube comments and so I really  appreciate shaking your hand and getting  to meet you in person so I hope you can  come to some of those events I also have  my carving workshops in  June and so all those links will be put  in the description and I will see you  soon  [Music]  you

